   "html": "<h3 class=\"recname\" id=\"SWS_Lin_00191\"><span class=\"kind\">function</span> Lin_SendFrame <span class=\"sws\"><a href=\"../../versions.html?id=SWS_Lin_00191\" title=\"Requirement im Versions- &amp; Revisions-Explorer anzeigen\">[SWS_Lin_00191]</a></span> <a href=\"https://www.autosar.org/fileadmin/standards/R20-11/CP/AUTOSAR_SWS_LINDriver.pdf#nameddest=SWS_Lin_00191\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"sws-pdf-link\" title=\"Spezifikations-PDF im Original öffnen: AUTOSAR_SWS_LINDriver.pdf (Anker: #SWS_Lin_00191, S. 46)\">📄 PDF</a></h3>",
