  {
   "t": "html",
   "html": "<pre class=\"syntax\"><a class=\"vis-app\" href=\"std.html#SWS_Std_00005\">Std_ReturnType</a> Lin_SendFrame (<a class=\"vis-app\" href=\"platform.html#SWS_Platform_00013\">uint8</a> Channel, const <a class=\"vis-app\" href=\"#SWS_Lin_00232\">Lin_PduType</a>* PduInfoPtr);</pre>",
   "tail": "\n"
  },
  {
   "t": "html",
   "html": "<div class=\"desc\"><p>Sends a LIN header and a LIN response, if necessary. The direction of the frame response (master response, slave response, slave - to - slave communication) is provided by the Pdu Info Ptr. Only used for LIN master nodes.</p></div>",
   "tail": "\n"
  },
  {
   "t": "html",
   "html": "<h3 class=\"recname\" id=\"SWS_Lin_00166\"><span class=\"kind\">function</span> Lin_GoToSleep <span class=\"sws\"><a href=\"../../versions.html?id=SWS_Lin_00166\" title=\"Requirement im Versions- &amp; Revisions-Explorer anzeigen\">[SWS_Lin_00166]</a></span> <a href=\"https://www.autosar.org/fileadmin/standards/R20-11/CP/AUTOSAR_SWS_LINDriver.pdf#nameddest=SWS_Lin_00166\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"sws-pdf-link\" title=\"Spezifikations-PDF im Original öffnen: AUTOSAR_SWS_LINDriver.pdf (Anker: #SWS_Lin_00166, S. 47)\">📄 PDF</a></h3>",
   "tail": "\n"
  },
  {
   "t": "html",
